      "id": "2070592005177328010",
      "text": "The repo covered everything about Loop engineering\n\nStop prompting your AI coding agents.\nStart designing loops that prompt them for you.\n\nThis is Loop Engineering the next evolution after prompt engineering.\n\nYou build the system once It handles triage, PRs, CI, dependencies, changelogs, and more automatically.\n\nInspired by Addy Osmani, Boris Cherny (Claude Code), and Peter Steinberger:\n\n“You shouldn’t be prompting coding agents anymore, You should be designing loops that prompt your agents.”\n\n- https://t.co/HHboXDGSP8",
