      "id": "2064019464803483676",
      "text": "Lots of discussion about designing loops right now (for good reason). As @steipete (AKA the Clawfather) says, you should design loops that prompt your agents.\n\nPrompting agents creates this perceived sense of a productive doom scroll. I want to shift from IN the loop to ON it. https://t.co/scnzRJtIsw",
